WEBVTT

00:00:01.416 --> 00:00:04.333
<i>As the Devourer rampages</i>
<i>through the Noodle District,</i>

00:00:04.416 --> 00:00:06.500
<i>I shudder to think of the carnage</i>

00:00:06.583 --> 00:00:09.250
<i>had the city not</i>
<i>already been long evacuated.</i>

00:00:09.333 --> 00:00:11.750
<i>Oh, no! the news building!</i>

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.208
<i>If anyone is lucky or foolish enough</i>
<i>to remain,</i>

00:00:22.291 --> 00:00:24.666
<i>the last flight takes off</i>
<i>from the NGTV rooftop.</i>

00:00:27.875 --> 00:00:29.500
Oh, no!

00:01:18.041 --> 00:01:20.000
Watch out!

00:01:20.083 --> 00:01:21.958
Get out!

00:01:22.041 --> 00:01:23.750
Watch out!

